#: scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 142ac2d2050dcae942b7e8bd3296242999d46957e8a934e7efbec05faf93e72e
#. default-sha256: 7ea44a8b6c84bd938d4a979301b925d057b466e5c00cb7fccff21ee1062edce5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_733932F8_99D6_4C79_AA66_A85288D2ABBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫The room with the fireplace was always kept in pristine "
"condition so they could entertain guests at any time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫O cômodo com a lareira era sempre mantido imaculado para "
"que pudessem entreter convidados a qualquer momento."

#: scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 776123a53317f4cfa183203cc4bfc54025353c4f10a74c00dffea1b8c7516937
#. default-sha256: 60690d75b4da23d46025244670120a1d99a8e29d4cab44ffef804adf0eb8c3dd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_93990DC2_AEFA_4178_8839_92F278F31293"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Walls colorfully decorated with tapestries and stained-glass windows gave testament to their "
"great fortune."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Paredes vivamente decoradas com tapeçarias e janelas com vitrais testemunhavam sua grande "
"fortuna."

#: scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecd97cb13589927da286489601f75e7e6d5212f90b7caa8329063ea75cad377d
#. default-sha256: 630fe61eddf72567ed3d3a012a44235676fd0feb5d2d1d7d558fd02dc9e8dc1c
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_C484908D_52F5_4594_95F3_954AECDEE522"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The servants’ first assignment every morning was to clean this room."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Toda manhã, a primeira tarefa dos serviçais era limpar esse cômodo."

#: scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b34cd8580f9cb8d8594e6060a9e76ef65331f81762e3092f116b7735fe0d4baf
#. default-sha256: d4aa9de587465437d5db485e4a82e4facfafc287ee90ab0c0d515adc3a8e49c8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18E382B8_1ECB_4769_8786_65433954308B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Pitchers, silver plates, and silverware were polished to a shine so they could be proudly "
"put to use at a moment’s notice."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Jarros e peças de prataria eram polidos a ponto de brilharem, de forma que pudessem ser "
"orgulhosamente postos em uso mesmo sem aviso."

#: scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6cac522c04e7708fabfc0557bb212f635071e5feb1fe1cb80b00837b1a7d008
#. default-sha256: 426c3e9284938fc8e16b02e3c5c89251880a10465fc36ea7730bab09b428b85b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EB3B5C9C_0AF1_4DC4_82C6_D50D1E9A46AC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And for events like their daughter’s birthday, the room served an even more important role."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E, para eventos como o aniversário de sua filha, o aposento servia a um propósito ainda mais "
"importante."

#: scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd7cb4d2cea8bc34f7379334ac62333de50e8660d4e6f10cc490ba90e4294d59
#. default-sha256: e25ac262124e0c10899983f5c3dcaec641bee681dc26df2af4b8109a1c911cfa
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D740EFB7_CD99_4401_8898_8761EF8F9271"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tables’ tops were removable, so they had ordered new tabletops with designs made "
"especially for this occasion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O topo das mesas era removível, então foram encomendados novos tampos com temas especiais "
"para essa ocasião."

#: scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f40bc5df4bd84d79c10049776b2719700ace94787550a090ddee7d74e995480
#. default-sha256: 86c494c3b26982c8da14b5b1de153ad2a33f4712ddb963f1e1d0c140e79ff415
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B7CAB2CD_4031_4E6C_A8AF_D0F1F486DDCB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And once the banquet had drawn to a close, tables speckled with half-empty wine glasses and "
"leftover candied fruits were moved off to the side to make room for—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫of course—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"the festivities."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E, quando o banquete terminava, mesas com taças de vinho meio cheias e restos de frutas "
"cristalizadas eram afastadas, dando lugar—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫obviamente—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫às festividades."

#: scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 28635da1e9984cfd958fa5d3d57cd36b3070089ad6eb735e3da54c536fe1400b
#. default-sha256: 2d695e8af08c728efcd2c86e0dd9b1538f5b7367eb29a61e32c4c1916d7f7e94
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E4783BD9_F5CF_4FB4_8F58_D3C1BFC940DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Good evening, Lady Nellie!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫You’re looking particularly lovely "
"today."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Boa noite, Senhorita Nellie!⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Você está particularmente adorável "
"hoje."

#: scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84c0f19f15c561ff18747efd1bcc887442e22c0cf03c71f03971cc47bbcead0f
#. default-sha256: 42ae843d21a0776c62cd5a512ada3301353a689bd4886b45c4cdd356a8610a22
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_BBFA0DBB_0B1F_4D9E_B286_7E65ADF5CEB8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nellie, I had these jewels cut just for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Nellie, eu mandei fazer essas joias especialmente para você."

#: scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f0cca437c082d2146db4f0f5d0dd9fa6d55b42c3b7923430b3bbca40275d8c5
#. default-sha256: 88819c6eef4812d7d670b19fbc39f5068f016c4166e0adaffc7c8fbe017f9206
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_836794CF_AE93_4D51_A19A_80F37CC09A07"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’ll let me have this dance, won’t you?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você vai me conceder esta dança, não é?"

