#: scenario:scenario_1ADB677C_2191_42BE_8E2F_65AE3D6B334A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec739fc6bbc2a783db0fba6746e149606be8472799ad777e042653f57958fb25
