msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫These are pretty good.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Want one? ⟪k:5⟫I know you like sweets.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫"
"They’re apples candied in rock sugar, I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Esses são muito bons.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Quer um? ⟪k:5⟫Eu sei que você gosta de doces.⟪k:6⟫"
"⟪k:7⟫Se não me engano, são maçãs cristalizadas em açúcar puro."

#: scenario:scenario_DA8B5329_49DB_4C6C_923F_FEDFDFE8DDA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 422eeba0f128ee7684e760a9e14333e1c5580e4e3946373605ada8bd8aeb9cf5
