msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Er?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Hein?"

#: scenario:scenario_68B11AA6_DD4F_4AF3_93EE_E20CEE066B19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22a0bf485e84fe24d34b30262a8c36764f9f78d55712cbdf3ab68edb72adb1f3
#. default-sha256: 2e3cd0325e3947083423522d9166de85856b17b0386183b08d6ffed82c08d23f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_68B11AA6_DD4F_4AF3_93EE_E20CEE066B19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫What do you ⟪k:2⟫think⟪k:3⟫ is the matter?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫They just keep ⟪k:6⟫coming⟪k:7⟫. "
"It never ⟪k:8⟫ends⟪k:9⟫."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫O que você ⟪k:2⟫acha⟪k:3⟫ que houve?!⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Eles simplesmente não param de ⟪k:6⟫"
"chegar⟪k:7⟫. Isso nunca ⟪k:8⟫acaba⟪k:9⟫."

#: scenario:scenario_1AB4B92C_FA3A_45DE_9E53_EC773E8EE5DD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75a9b34c888242a7078562899f47181d5686989b11e08b4fa3cc731608335151
#. default-sha256: 553776edc4a87e6f6db791e697b3c8bee7d0191bd991518616677d9fbb988206
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1AB4B92C_FA3A_45DE_9E53_EC773E8EE5DD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫It’s driving me up the wall.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Everyone’s just repeating the same lines they’ve "
"been taught.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫They all think pretty jewels and requests to dance are enough to make a "
"girl swoon."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Estão me deixando maluca.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Todo mundo está repetindo as mesmas frases que lhe "
"foram ensinadas.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Todos eles pensam que belas joias e pedidos de dança são suficientes "
"para fazer uma garota suspirar."

#: scenario:scenario_C20CD433_B0CD_417B_B181_C24666F35234
