msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We ⟪k:1⟫are⟪k:2⟫ a reasonably distinguished family,⟪k:3⟫so there are a number of different "
"houses⟪k:4⟫that would like to have connections with us."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nós ⟪k:1⟫somos⟪k:2⟫ uma família razoavelmente distinta; portanto, há várias casas que "
"adorariam ter conexões conosco."

#: scenario:scenario_C5D088F7_7505_40FF_A12D_242ABC9EEE1F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
