msgid "⟪k:0⟫Now, attend to your princess—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as a proper prince should!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Agora, tome conta de sua princesa—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫como um príncipe deveria!"

#: scenario:scenario_95405DAD_48F4_4D56_9E62_07306CB18DAD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ae013d250dc5ab8c4be270880676bc0b65feb4b7787201296665c963d424c02
