msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Oh, jeez, how did I get myself into this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Ah, caramba, como eu me meti nessa?"

#: scenario:scenario_CF203C0A_1FA5_403E_A224_1159518A90E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67ae5ce6537494d37f000b91e4271a2228b90942768a0e87358ddc0dfa1119bc
#. default-sha256: 3de7af061e797615f94ea0961176ee52e691bf78fbc1a1c03fdb651ca4221678
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CF203C0A_1FA5_403E_A224_1159518A90E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Nellie’s skirt fluttered along with her as she stepped in time to the music. ⟪k:3⟫"
"She was not only a skilled singer, but a skilled dancer as well."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A saia de Nellie esvoaçou enquanto ela entrava no ritmo da música. ⟪k:3⟫Ela não "
"apenas era uma habilidosa cantora, como uma habilidosa dançarina."

#: scenario:scenario_0FE7527D_9FFD_42C4_B949_FB69FE44D819
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96d84c1c2c8de87e67717762898afe54d3b314e48335f71f65dd0158dab8fdcf
#. default-sha256: 68f372371f6b39904ae70914df4745dda811482e8903bf8569bb147353bff851
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FE7527D_9FFD_42C4_B949_FB69FE44D819"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell, on the other hand, fumbled over his own feet trying to keep up. ⟪k:1⟫One would be hard-"
"pressed to describe his dance abilities as “good,” even as flattery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mell, por outro lado, tropeçava nos próprios pés tentando acompanhar. ⟪k:1⟫Seria difícil "
"descrever sua habilidade na dança como “boa”, mesmo que de forma a lisonjear."

#: scenario:scenario_2F0D3F6C_E102_4BAC_BC8F_248411697685
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40cdd3a502c3771a47b67b859429593120e63d8465dce364e947bed749f8178a
#. default-sha256: 18fe49b43a36fa590297036246013b6f341a5831317572457f9da01ad9651fc5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2F0D3F6C_E102_4BAC_BC8F_248411697685"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though boys of his pedigree were taught to dance as part of their etiquette lessons, he "
"found himself more being dragged around by his sister. ⟪k:1⟫He could hardly be said to be "
"“attending” to her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora garotos do seu pedigree fossem ensinados a dançar como parte das suas lições de "
"etiqueta, ele sentiu como se estivesse sendo arrastado pela sua irmã. ⟪k:1⟫Dificilmente poderia "
"se dizer que ele estava \"tomando conta\" dela."

#: scenario:scenario_E0CF0A52_ED46_405C_A60C_E2266E048503
