msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫(Is-⟪k:4⟫Isso é humilhante!)"

#: scenario:scenario_1793C260_8672_4F68_8AF1_A79776213C40
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a151aaa57f81487186c26c0b7bfded98ba053f6d420ab5d40cf79c8ff448d126
#. default-sha256: 0c9b5143410157e6df24e4b97d95d815d24eeb40b07629fe9772a5ccf8674f3b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1793C260_8672_4F68_8AF1_A79776213C40"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Because his parents had been hands-off in raising him, largely giving him free rein to "
"study and learn what he pleased, Mell looked like a tangled-up marionette."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Como seus parentes o criaram sem muitas amarras, dando-lhe liberdade total para estudar "
"e aprender o que quisesse, Mell parecia uma marionete desajeitada."

#: scenario:scenario_B38D3DDA_0AD6_4373_87C9_4FF4EB6C9C48
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6edcf45b95bfc8b6f49fe89f9fc9a91898915d02679f0938f242083f763ca117
#. default-sha256: 622e4581dc5d8a7cc6e9944676bf558b9d89edad6b2e8f23ac4c1c091ad774ed
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B38D3DDA_0AD6_4373_87C9_4FF4EB6C9C48"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫From throughout the hall, he could hear giggling, uncomfortable chuckling, and people "
"coughing to disguise their laughter."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por todo o salão, ele podia ouvir risadinhas, sorrisos de desconforto e pessoas tossindo "
"para disfarçar o deboche."

#: scenario:scenario_278D5AED_96DC_439B_9E27_53B3FEE972A0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e36b5761531ff580d448b852ac2218ac904e52a58f1f772c7b29b8450f9fb0df
