msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Nellie alone enjoyed her time dancing with her brother—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫and quite thoroughly, "
"at that."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Apenas Nellie aproveitou seu tempo dançando com o irmão—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫e bastante, que se "
"diga."

#: scenario:scenario_328DB8FA_B8B2_403D_B8D5_D807A430EC74
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 70f4274cc3ba6530387246bdeed1c20d96d14cd8769485755abcff021e5f0b16
