"⟪k:0⟫It was their parents who first cracked under the pressure. ⟪k:1⟫Just as their father was "
"about to give an exaggerated cough and stop the music,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Foram seus pais os primeiros a quebrar ante a pressão. ⟪k:1⟫Quando seu Pai estava prestes a "
"dar uma pigarreada exagerada e parar a música,"

