#: scenario:scenario_377154AA_0D86_4BAB_AD78_DA7FCE852038
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 734e8f38d477457150abdaec42d46c6123efd373435ab6222511c2e2d0a35ea8
