msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The music came to a stop, and the party guests began bustling. ⟪k:3⟫The siblings’ "
"father spoke up sternly above the noise in order to quell the spreading commotion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A música parou, e os convidados da festa ficaram agitados. ⟪k:3⟫O anfitrião falou "
"em tom grave, acima do burburinho, para sufocar a comoção que se espalhava."

#: scenario:scenario_287512F0_CF6F_4350_BE3A_A53B0D268FEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ab5ab8c5710e5d6e0d16d8a72983184f87c05759913e0824deb96dcb4bbc896
