#: scenario:scenario_9945FD3E_C3CD_4C4F_9EFC_5485DE160387
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf0c3727492c7abc6a8ee9ec7a1ccf087cc93b6aadfb1ed190a64ceec0f594dd
