msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9945FD3E_C3CD_4C4F_9EFC_5485DE160387"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They lived in a country where the weather was nothing if not unpredictable. Rain was a "
"frequent occurrence there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eles viviam em um país onde o clima não era nada além de imprevisível. A chuva era bastante "
"frequente."

#: scenario:scenario_9ABF9CB4_570D_4FD5_AD53_F5B891C609DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 841641e3dc2d34b952917094874b964393d8c24ba9e99a48c5b407efbfd77f8f
