msgctxt "scenario:scenario_9ABF9CB4_570D_4FD5_AD53_F5B891C609DA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The stretches of time with clear skies grew longer as summer approached, but the weather was "
"still somewhat unstable on the cusp of the two seasons."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Enquanto o verão se aproximava, os períodos de céu limpo aumentavam, mas o clima ainda era "
"um tanto instável na troca das duas estações."

#: scenario:scenario_0FFFB7F2_FB82_4B25_B132_BB24E1ECB83C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fa59279375cf96d468ca833c7a9898ac4f1d4f0d5bf2607e6ee4da685d8b72f7
