msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0FFFB7F2_FB82_4B25_B132_BB24E1ECB83C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They had a strong wind that night as well, which turned the raindrops into little spears on "
"the window. ⟪k:1⟫Were the party to continue on any longer, no one would be able to go home."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eles também tiveram ventos fortes naquela noite, o que transformou as gotas de chuva em "
"pequenas lanças na janela. ⟪k:1⟫Se a festa se alongasse mais, ninguém poderia ir para casa."

#: scenario:scenario_34F956BC_01B8_4DCF_A197_572FFE54D844
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25ee4c703316a88a6d0c8ab067a4b2fdfb2b0252b35abc17bb816106a4e0235c
