msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although their father was quite concerned that Nellie had not got on with any of the "
"aristocrat boys, he decided to cut the festivities short."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora seu pai estivesse bastante consternado por Nellie não ter se dado bem com nenhum dos "
"garotos aristocratas, ele decidiu acabar com as festividades."

