msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He said my hair looked like the color of fallen leaves. ⟪k:3⟫Fallen leaves!⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Just thinking about that ugly smirk has me fuming."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ele disse que meu cabelo parecia com a cor de folhas caídas. ⟪k:3⟫Folhas caídas!"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Só de pensar naquele sorriso pretensioso já me deixa soltando fumaça."

#: scenario:scenario_03360B9C_29AF_4328_8A4D_E2DB3F8C1165
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 75b9736acde356c173a6ad8e460c7e1e216cadc1a643a4fa7f4d790ede824821
