msgctxt "scenario:scenario_03360B9C_29AF_4328_8A4D_E2DB3F8C1165"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫And yet he acts like nothing happened.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫He even calls me “Lady Nellie,” for "
"goodness’ sake."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫E ele ainda age como se nada tivesse acontecido.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ele até me chama de "
"“Senhorita Nellie”, pelo amor de Deus."

